schema: "0.3"
id: echo-of-manifestation-character-the-grand-manifestation
type: image
service: gemini

prompt:
  text: >
    Dark fantasy concept art of the Grand Manifestation — the final boss entity. This is NOT
    a humanoid figure but an abstract, shape-shifting entity made entirely of crystallized
    transmutation energy. Its form is composed of jagged geometric crystalline structures
    that constantly shift and reconfigure — shards of solidified alchemical force that catch
    and refract light in impossible ways. The entity simultaneously reflects all weapon types
    used by the player: one crystalline protrusion forms a massive blade, another a bow shape
    with arrows of frozen light, another a barricade of interlocking geometric plates, another
    a potion flask shape leaking liquid energy. The entire entity is rendered in STRICTLY black
    and white only — no amber, no indigo, no color whatsoever. Pure white crystalline edges
    against pure black void, with infinite shades of gray in the crystalline depths. The
    geometry is wrong — non-Euclidean angles, shapes that shouldn't connect but do, forms that
    suggest a weapon from one angle and something else entirely from another. No single fixed
    shape — it is all weapons, all tools, all transmutations given malevolent form. The
    background is absolute void. Painterly style but with sharp crystalline edges. The mood
    is cosmic horror through the lens of alchemy — the transmutation principle taken to its
    logical, terrifying extreme.
  negative: "bright, cheerful, cartoon, anime, humanoid, face, limbs, organic, flesh, colorful, amber, indigo, warm tones, clean magic, simple monster, generic boss, low detail, flat shading, any color except black white and gray"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1024
    height: 1536
    aspect_ratio: "2:3"

tags: [character, final-boss, grand-manifestation, entity, concept-art, dark-fantasy, black-and-white, abstract]
